1
00:00:00,246 --> 00:00:00,932
Todo lo que tienes

2
00:00:00,942 --> 00:00:01,742
que saber para hacerte

3
00:00:01,752 --> 00:00:03,009
rico en GTA 6.

4
00:00:03,429 --> 00:00:04,106
Y quédate hasta el

5
00:00:04,116 --> 00:00:04,544
final,

6
00:00:04,649 --> 00:00:05,264
porque hay un error

7
00:00:05,274 --> 00:00:05,981
que te puede dejar

8
00:00:05,991 --> 00:00:06,593
sin nada.

9
00:00:07,008 --> 00:00:07,621
PASO 1:

10
00:00:07,705 --> 00:00:08,881
empieza por lo pequeño.

11
00:00:09,483 --> 00:00:10,588
Tiendas y gasolineras...

12
00:00:10,672 --> 00:00:11,602
dinero en efectivo,

13
00:00:11,707 --> 00:00:12,739
directo al bolsillo.

14
00:00:13,155 --> 00:00:13,788
PASO 2:

15
00:00:13,841 --> 00:00:14,812
apunta más alto.

16
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:16,312
En los golpes grandes

17
00:00:16,322 --> 00:00:17,406
no siempre hay billetes:

18
00:00:17,469 --> 00:00:18,061
hay joyas,

19
00:00:18,135 --> 00:00:18,922
lingotes de oro...

20
00:00:19,047 --> 00:00:19,619
o droga.

21
00:00:20,039 --> 00:00:20,753
PASO 3:

22
00:00:20,869 --> 00:00:21,535
ese botín no vale

23
00:00:21,545 --> 00:00:22,119
nada hasta que se

24
00:00:22,129 --> 00:00:22,652
lo vendes a un

25
00:00:22,662 --> 00:00:23,294
perista.

26
00:00:23,888 --> 00:00:24,900
Hay uno para joyas,

27
00:00:25,056 --> 00:00:25,781
otro para el oro,

28
00:00:25,886 --> 00:00:26,713
otro para la droga...

29
00:00:26,839 --> 00:00:27,566
y se desbloquean con

30
00:00:27,576 --> 00:00:28,281
la historia.

31
00:00:28,701 --> 00:00:29,457
PASO 4:

32
00:00:29,582 --> 00:00:30,799
roba coches por encargo.

33
00:00:31,397 --> 00:00:32,255
Te llegan al móvil...

34
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:33,016
y te pagan según

35
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:34,017
cómo llegue el coche.

36
00:00:34,624 --> 00:00:35,698
Si está destrozado,

37
00:00:35,833 --> 00:00:36,661
cobras menos.

38
00:00:37,076 --> 00:00:37,732
Y ojo al error

39
00:00:37,742 --> 00:00:38,652
que te puede arruinar:

40
00:00:38,757 --> 00:00:39,494
si mueres con mucho

41
00:00:39,504 --> 00:00:40,363
efectivo encima,

42
00:00:40,498 --> 00:00:41,654
puedes perder buena parte...

43
00:00:41,892 --> 00:00:42,391
o TODO.

44
00:00:42,989 --> 00:00:43,758
Pasa antes por el

45
00:00:43,768 --> 00:00:44,339
cajero.

46
00:00:44,759 --> 00:00:45,894
¿Cuánto dinero llevas tú?

47
00:00:46,483 --> 00:00:47,649
Te leo en comentarios.

